OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm approval may face legal
OL,4,Achallenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is considering taking legal
OL,7,Faction after plans for a large-scale
OL,8,Fsolar farm were approved.
OL,10,FPlans for the Beacon Fen Energy Park,
OL,11,Fnear Sleaford, which developers claim
OL,12,Fcould power up to 130,000 homes, were
OL,13,Fapproved by the government last week,
OL,14,Fdespite public concern.
OL,16,FLincolnshire County Council leader Sean
OL,17,FMatthews said the "appalling" decision
OL,18,Fwas "another attack on our beautiful
OL,19,Fcountryside", accusing the government
OL,20,Fof pushing the project through without
OL,21,Fproper regard for local opinion.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
